# Privacy Policy for specially translatiob decice

Last updated: August 2026

## 1. Overview
specially translatiob decice ("the Bot") is an interactive entertainment application for Discord. We care about user privacy and follow a strict data minimization policy.

## 2. Data Collection and Storage
* **No Persistent Data Storage:** We do not collect, store, or log any personal data, user messages, or Discord metadata in external databases or persistent storage.
* **Transient Processing:** Message content and user inputs are processed strictly in-memory and in real-time solely to execute bot commands and generate responses via API models. Once the response is sent to Discord, the data is immediately discarded.
* **Third-Party Services:** Text prompts sent to external AI/translation APIs are used purely for dynamic text generation and are not stored or retained by us.

## 3. Opt-Out
Since no user data or message content is stored, tracked, or logged by the Bot, there is no user tracking to opt out of.

## 4. Contact
If you have any questions regarding this privacy policy, please contact the developer via Discord.
